  "ingredients": [
    "14 ounce boneless, skinless chicken breast",
    "1 cup pork rinds (crushed)",
    "1/3 cup parmesan cheese",
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "2 large egg (beaten)",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "1 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "1 teaspoon black pepper",
    "1/2 cup erythritol",
    "1/2 cup unseasoned rice vinegar",
    "4 tablespoon low-carb ketchup",
    "1 tablespoon soy sauce (or coconut aminos)",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Cube chicken into ~1″ chunks.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-sweet-sour-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50637-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/img_4114.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a food processor, combine pork rinds, parmesan cheese, and almond flour. Grind until a meal-like substance is formed. Then, dip the chicken in the egg and coat in the pork rind mixture and set on a plate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-sweet-sour-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50637-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/img_4120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the oils in a cast iron skillet over medium heat. Once hot, add the chicken (in small batches) and cook.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-sweet-sour-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50637-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/img_4125.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the meantime, combine all the sauce ingredients into a saucepan and whisk over high heat while it boils down.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-sweet-sour-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50637-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/img_4137.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the chicken is cooked, remove from the pan and continue cooking the rest of your batches.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-sweet-sour-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50637-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/img_4147.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, pour the sauce over the chicken and mix together to coat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-sweet-sour-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50637-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/img_4148.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-sweet-sour-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50637-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
